. This is Dataplot program file    DEXPLOT.DP
. Purpose--Generate 10 plots essential to the analysis
.       of 2-level factorial designs
. Date--December 2000
.
. Assumptions:
.    1. Data is in Y
.    2. Factors are in X1, X2, X3, ...
.    3. Total number of factors is in K
.
. -----start point-----
.
device 1 x11
device 2 postscript
dimension 100 variables
.
.  Following implement Jim Filliben's default settings
.
title displacement 2
tic offset units screen
tic offset 5 5
set write decimals 2
box shadow hw 0 0
title case asis
legend case asis
tic label case asis
character case asis all
tic label case asis
.
